    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/bc583c34b4af876a495c44be51f2236d.webp?t=1754119345\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/584bc30ff9a768fd38aa25e7df123e7e.poster.avif?t=1754119345\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/584bc30ff9a768fd38aa25e7df123e7e.webm?t=1754119345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/584bc30ff9a768fd38aa25e7df123e7e.mp4?t=1754119345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>- Battle Royale Brawl featuring 33 players<br>- 12+ Characters with Unique Actions and Ultimates<br>- Features a Solos Mode, which focuses on individual mechanics, and Trios Mode, which adds teamplay to the mix<br>- High-quality cartoon rendered characters with a variety of costumes, animated Emotes, and cute Emojis<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/a615d2097f3557be3e626e2e17d2d375.webp?t=1754119345\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/54d88ae0e1b15d2514cb16fdd351a350.poster.avif?t=1754119345\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/54d88ae0e1b15d2514cb16fdd351a350.webm?t=1754119345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/54d88ae0e1b15d2514cb16fdd351a350.mp4?t=1754119345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The key to ASURAJANG's combat is mastering combos and counters, like in a fighting game.<br>Perform a Combo Attack when the enemy lets their guard down to claim victory in battle.<br>But beware - if the opponent dodges your attack, they will get a chance to counter.<br>Master the art of mixing attacks, dodges, and counters to blow away your enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/a4015fc67139c8b656f3d3140221ac6a.webp?t=1754119345\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/ee6feb0ba40054ab8aff951c1463f927.poster.avif?t=1754119345\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/ee6feb0ba40054ab8aff951c1463f927.webm?t=1754119345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/ee6feb0ba40054ab8aff951c1463f927.mp4?t=1754119345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each Asura possesses a unique Ultimate Action.<br>Use these Ultimates to eliminate enemy players, protect teammates, or simply survive.<br>A single Ultimate can change the outcome of the game.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/bc583c34b4af876a495c44be51f2236d.webp?t=1754119345\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/584bc30ff9a768fd38aa25e7df123e7e.poster.avif?t=1754119345\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/584bc30ff9a768fd38aa25e7df123e7e.webm?t=1754119345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/584bc30ff9a768fd38aa25e7df123e7e.mp4?t=1754119345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>- Battle Royale Brawl featuring 33 players<br>- 12+ Characters with Unique Actions and Ultimates<br>- Features a Solos Mode, which focuses on individual mechanics, and Trios Mode, which adds teamplay to the mix<br>- High-quality cartoon rendered characters with a variety of costumes, animated Emotes, and cute Emojis<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/a615d2097f3557be3e626e2e17d2d375.webp?t=1754119345\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/54d88ae0e1b15d2514cb16fdd351a350.poster.avif?t=1754119345\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/54d88ae0e1b15d2514cb16fdd351a350.webm?t=1754119345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/54d88ae0e1b15d2514cb16fdd351a350.mp4?t=1754119345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The key to ASURAJANG's combat is mastering combos and counters, like in a fighting game.<br>Perform a Combo Attack when the enemy lets their guard down to claim victory in battle.<br>But beware - if the opponent dodges your attack, they will get a chance to counter.<br>Master the art of mixing attacks, dodges, and counters to blow away your enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/a4015fc67139c8b656f3d3140221ac6a.webp?t=1754119345\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/ee6feb0ba40054ab8aff951c1463f927.poster.avif?t=1754119345\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/ee6feb0ba40054ab8aff951c1463f927.webm?t=1754119345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549130/extras/ee6feb0ba40054ab8aff951c1463f927.mp4?t=1754119345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each Asura possesses a unique Ultimate Action.<br>Use these Ultimates to eliminate enemy players, protect teammates, or simply survive.<br>A single Ultimate can change the outcome of the game.",
    "short_description": "ASURAJANG is an online action PVP game that anyone can enjoy. It features an easy-to-pick-up Battle Royale mode with trendy Anime-style characters and combat that packs a serious punch. Pick your favorite character and engage in strategic battle among 33 players to claim victory!",
